# local-only: raw/source photo archive (web-sized copies live in public/images)
# - legacy-originals/     pristine pre-optimization originals
# - new-pictures-raw/     unsorted camera dump (was public/New pictures - moved
#                         out because everything under public/ gets deployed)
# - new-pictures-matched/ renamed source photos matched to their published names
/files
# local-only: raw Instagram screenshot sources; the cropped, web-sized copies
# used by the site live directly in public/images (not in dropped/).
/public/images/dropped/

